        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/MarioNawfal/status/2004481058092298673",
        "text": "OCEAN PLASTIC NIGHTMARE: THE STRAW SWAP DID NOTHING\n\nThe top 3 countries flooding the ocean with plastic? Malaysia dumps 73,000 metric tons a year. India cranks out over 126,000. And the Philippines? A jaw-dropping 356,000 metric tons - every single year.\n\nAnd no, your soggy paper straw isn’t fixing any of it.\n\nWhile rivers vomit city waste straight into the sea by the hundreds of thousands of tons, you’re out here sipping sad lattes through limp cardboard like it’s saving the planet.\n\nIt’s not.\n\nSource: Viral Maniacs",
